    {
      "question": "What is YouTube Thumbnail Design & Creative Testing?",
      "answer": "It is a practical design certification focused on creating original YouTube thumbnails through visual communication, Photoshop production and creative testing awareness."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the course duration?",
      "answer": "Four weeks with 32 learning hours."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the fee?",
